<p>Today's brief covers stories from 4 to 5 November.</p>

<figure class="dgm">
<div class="dgm-stack">
<div class="dgm-tier"><small>Models and security</small><div class="dgm-nodes"><span class="hl">GPT-6 Cyber<em>gated vulnerability research</em></span><span>Apple flaw<em>old bug, new exploitation</em></span></div></div>
